{
  "format": "kshader",
  "generator": "Kekenik Shader",
  "graph": {
    "comments": [
      {
        "color": "#60a5fa",
        "id": "note_inputs",
        "position": {
          "x": 22,
          "y": 34
        },
        "size": {
          "h": 73,
          "w": 762
        },
        "text": "Everything the shading needs: a **light direction** (a material parameter — swap in the engine's Main Light node if you prefer scene lighting), the world normal and the view direction. Shared by the next blocks through portals."
      },
      {
        "color": "#fb923c",
        "id": "note_cel",
        "position": {
          "x": 988,
          "y": 34
        },
        "size": {
          "h": 39,
          "w": 762
        },
        "text": "The **Toon Light** kit: `N·L` → half-Lambert → 3 quantised bands, mixed between *Shadow* and *Lit*. "
      },
      {
        "color": "#fbbf24",
        "id": "note_spec",
        "position": {
          "x": 988,
          "y": 679
        },
        "size": {
          "h": 39,
          "w": 2072
        },
        "text": "Blinn half-vector `H = normalize(L + V)`; the highlight is `step(1 − size, N·H)` (hard, cel-style) and only shows on the lit side (× toon level)."
      },
      {
        "color": "#22d3ee",
        "id": "note_rim",
        "position": {
          "x": 3264,
          "y": 34
        },
        "size": {
          "h": 56,
          "w": 542
        },
        "text": "The **Fresnel kit** gives a thin glow on silhouettes; it is HDR so a Bloom post-effect picks it up."
      },
      {
        "color": "#f87171",
        "id": "note_outline",
        "position": {
          "x": 3264,
          "y": 708
        },
        "size": {
          "h": 39,
          "w": 1154
        },
        "text": "No inverted hull needed: `1 − N·V` is ≈ 1 on the silhouette, so `smoothstep(1 − width, …)` paints a line exactly where the surface turns away from the camera."
      },
      {
        "color": "#4ade80",
        "id": "note_mix",
        "position": {
          "x": 4622,
          "y": 34
        },
        "size": {
          "h": 56,
          "w": 848
        },
        "text": "`final = lerp(cel + specular + rim, outline colour, outline mask)` — the outline always wins, so the silhouette stays crisp."
      },
      {
        "color": "#a78bfa",
        "id": "note_out",
        "position": {
          "x": 5674,
          "y": 34
        },
        "size": {
          "h": 56,
          "w": 300
        },
        "text": "Unlit master: the shading above is the final colour."
      }
    ],
